  (https://www.tensorflow.org/extras/candidate_sampling.pdf)

  Also see Section 3 of [Jean et al., 2014](http://arxiv.org/abs/1412.2007)
  ([pdf](http://arxiv.org/pdf/1412.2007.pdf)) for the math.

